# ---------------------------------------------------------

scratch/
sandbox/
local/

# ---------------------------------------------------------
# DON'T IGNORE:
# ---------------------------------------------------------
# - linker scripts
# - startup files
# - generated register headers
# - compile_commands.json (if using clang tooling)
# - reproducible generated assets
#
# Reproducibility > convenience.
# =========================================================